' S-108 (Mete karari 2026-09-20): CLASS degiskeni REFERANSTIR; DIM yalniz NULL referans olusturur, nesne NEW ile dogar.
' Hic atanmamis nesne degiskeni uzerinden SANAL cagri -> dort motorda anlamli calisma zamani hatasi.
CLASS Animal
    PUBLIC
    VIRTUAL METHOD Speak() AS I32
        RETURN 1
    END METHOD
END CLASS
DIM a AS Animal
PRINT a.Speak()
